><given-names>MCC</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Cooper</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Tisdale</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Development of an <italic>in vitro</italic> model system to investigate the mechanism of muscle protein catabolism induced by proteolysis-inducing factor</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>2002</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>1628</fpage><lpage>1633</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||86|1628||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12085214</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gomes-Marcondes</surname><given-names>MCC</given-names></name><name><surname>Tisdale</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Induction of protein catabolism and the ubiquitin&#x02013;proteasome pathway by mild oxidative stress</article-title><source>Cancer Lett</source><year>2002</year><volume>180</volume><fpage>69</fpage><lpage>74</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Lett||180|69||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11911972</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lecker</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name><name><surname>Solomon</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Mitch</surname><given-names>WE</given-names></name><name><surname>Goldberg</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Muscle protein breakdown and the critical role of the ubiquitin&#x02013;proteasome pathway in normal and disease states</article-title><source>J Nutr</source><year>1999</year><volume>129</volume><fpage>227S</fpage><lpage>237S</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Nutr||129|227S||bib15|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9915905</pub-id></citation></re